NOT FINANCIAL ADVICE

This software analyses market data, simulates trading strategies, and records
transactions. Nothing it produces is financial, investment, tax, or legal
advice, and no output should be relied upon as a recommendation to buy or sell
any security.

Backtested and simulated results are not evidence of future performance. They
are computed against retroactively adjusted historical prices, over a universe
selected with hindsight, and without slippage, spread, fees, or the effect of
the orders themselves on the market. Every such figure is an upper bound.

Trading involves substantial risk of loss. The copyright holder accepts no
responsibility for any financial loss arising from use of this software.
